00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,560
噗 谁有空管你们俩啊
Plbbt! Nobody cares about you two.

351
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:41,740
首先 我们得先清理昨晚派对的垃圾
Well, first, we have to clean the party mess up.

352
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,160
昨晚我跟安迪打扫完了
Andy and I did it last night

353
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,340
在你不知去何处鬼混的时候
when you didn't come back.

354
00:15:45,260 --> 00:15:47,400
某人是不是该放轻松点
Um, can someone here mellow out

355
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:49,500
塞点煎饼进她的"煎饼洞"里啊
and put some pancakes in her pancake hole?

356
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,960
没事 卡洛琳 我明白
No, Caroline, I get it.

357
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,940
我跟麦克斯一路以来的情路不顺
It's been a rocky ride for Max and me.

358
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:55,680
我跟她刚认识时 我有个女朋友
See, when we met, I had a girlfriend.

359
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,520
但他从来没告诉过她 然后...
Which he never told her about, and--

360
00:15:57,940 --> 00:15:58,440
然后接着吃啊
And keep eating.

361
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:00,100
因为这样
and because of that,

362
00:16:00,280 --> 00:16:01,800
我和麦克斯没有真正在一起过
Max and I never really got together,

363
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,400
而我也跟那女人分手了
and then that girl and I broke up,

364
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:05,700
后来再见到麦克斯时 我...
and by the time I saw Max again, I was--

365
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:06,300
订了婚准备结婚
Engaged to be married?

366
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:09,540
是的 我当时准备结婚了
Yeah, yeah, I was gonna get married.

367
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:11,080
等等 是跟之前那女朋友吗
Wait, to that same girlfriend?

368
00:16:11,420 --> 00:16:12,880
不是的 另外一个
Different one. Different one.

369
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:16,500
但那事后来也没成
Yeah, but that didn't work out either,

370
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:18,000
之后我也再交过几个女朋友
and I've had a couple girlfriends since--

371
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:19,000
哟 还"几个"呢
Oh! Only a couple!

372
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,440
是啊 但是跟她们也一个都没成
Yeah, none of them seemed to work out.

373
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,140
她们都取代不了麦克斯
None of them are Max.

374
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:29,000
帮我留一个煎饼
Hey, save me a pancake.

375
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:31,340
卡洛琳好像想把它们统统吃光
It looks like Caroline has plans to eat them all.

376
00:16:33,820 --> 00:16:35,960
麦克斯 你这个让人"去死吧"计划
Well, Max, as far as the "suck it" plan goes,

377
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,980
没让某人死成 还自己成了"你去吸吧"
it looks like somebody sucked something.

378
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,180
煎饼 煎饼洞
Pancakes, pancake hole.

379
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,040
他是个好人啦
He's a good guy.

380
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,440
他看起来不错啦
Yeah, he seems cool.

381
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:50,740
虽然常常坠入爱河 不过...
Kinda falls in love a lot, but hey...

382
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:53,100
我没叫他说这些
And I did not tell him to say that.

383
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:54,600
他从来不听我指挥 太性感了
He never does what I say. It's hot.

384
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,740
"不过"什么
"But hey" what?

385
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:58,880
还继续说啊
Oh, we're continuing?

386
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:00,580
我不知道怎么说
Um, I don't know.

387
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,120
我说可能有些偏颇 但麦克斯
Maybe I'm partial, but Max,

388
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,220
你是个"A"级姑娘
You're an "A."

389
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,720
而他感觉只是个"B"级男
He kind of seems like a "B."

390
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:05,940
是"B-"
Minus.

391
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:08,460
首先 看好了
First of all, look at me.

392
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,960
我这是"D"级胸器
I am clearly a "D,"

393
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:14,220
而且他也没有整天坠入爱河好吗
and I don't think he falls in love a lot.

394
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:18,120
天啊 我对煎饼爱爱爱不完
Man, I love, love, love pancakes.

395
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:20,740
如果可以 我真想娶个煎饼
If I could, I would marry a pancake.

396
00:17:29,460 --> 00:17:30,680
几点了
What time is it?

397
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,320
开业首日嘛
Well, it's the first day open.

398
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,140
大家可能昨晚都玩太累了
All those people are probably tired from the party.

399
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:39,720
有道理
Yeah.

400
00:17:40,380 --> 00:17:42,200
你看 我们也忘了打开这个
Oh, and look! We forgot to light it up.

401
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,340
人家不知道我们开门了
People don't know we're open.

402
00:17:45,140 --> 00:17:49,340
倒数五 四 三 二...
In five, four, three, two.

403
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:52,620
上班吧
Go to work.

404
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:01,140
-第一天嘛 -是的
- First day! - Yep.

405
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:04,660
没人来
No one's here.

406
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,820
记得 我们一天只要卖70个小蛋糕
Remember: all we have to sell is 70 cupcakes a day

407
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:09,560
就能开下去了
to keep on track.

408
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:11,640
70个小蛋糕 不难嘛
70 cupcakes? That's not so hard.

409
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,020
我们再重开一次那灯吧
Maybe we should do the light again.

410
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:22,080
倒数五 四 三 二...
In five, four, three, two.

411
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:28,360
现在几点了
What time is it now?

412
00:18:32,980 --> 00:18:35,720
明天 我们只需卖掉140个小蛋糕就行
Tomorrow, we only need to sell 140 cupcakes.

413
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,020
140个小蛋糕 不难嘛
140 cupcakes! That's not so hard.

414
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:39,900
我们今天卖掉了几个
How many did we sell today?

415
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,180
四个
Four.

416
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,940
都卖给强尼了
And all were to Johnny.

417
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,920
我觉得我犯了大错
I think I've made a terrible mistake.

418
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,500
才刚开始三天而已
It's only been three days.

419
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,640
生意会慢慢起步的
Business will pick up.

420
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,000
不 是跟强尼的事
No, with Johnny.

421
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,640
情况不同了 他现在是单身
It's different now that he's available.

422
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,040
说不定我是那种人
Maybe I'm the kind of person

423
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,780
只喜欢得不到的东西
who only wants something they can't have,

424
00:18:56,780 --> 00:18:58,200
然后一旦得到又不喜欢了
and then when they get it, they don't want it anymore.

425
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:01,700
那你对我们的小蛋糕店也有这种感觉吗
Okay, but do you feel that way about the cupcake shop too?

426
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:04,160
没有 我爱我们的小蛋糕店
No, I love our cupcake shop.

427
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,280
哇 这是我第一次脱口说出
Wow, that's the first time I've ever said

428
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,780
我爱某样东西呢
I loved anything out loud,

429
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:09,440
我只对感冒糖浆说过[喝多会上瘾]
except for robitussin.

430
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:13,260
强尼来了
It's Johnny.

431
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,100
好吧 我知道我该怎么做
Well, I know what I have to do.

432
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:17,540
麦克斯 你不能现在反悔啊
Max, you can't change your mind about him now.

433
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,000
他是我们唯一的顾客
He's our only customer!

434
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:21,800
我一直以来都很喜欢他呢
By the way, I've always loved him.

435
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:23,760
你们好啊
Hey, guys.

436
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:26,440
我们能进厨房里谈谈吗
Um, could we talk in the kitchen?

437
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:29,900
等等 在你进去之前 我想说
Wait, before you go, I just wanna say

438
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:31,300
无论生活中发生了多少挫折
that no matter what goes down in life,

439
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,160
我们的店永远对你敞开
we are always open to your business.

440
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:39,860
我们不是要在疯狂地在厨房搞一炮
We're either gonna have crazy kitchen sex

441
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:40,940
就是我要被甩了
or I'm getting expelled.

442
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,080
我们不会在这搞一炮的
We're not having kitchen sex.

443
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:44,680
这里太脏了
It's way too dirty in here

444
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:47,280
被其他在这搞过的人弄得太脏了
from other people having kitchen sex.

445
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:49,840
所以就是我要被甩了
So I'm getting expelled?

446
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,000
我们俩很怪 很纠结对吧
It's weird, right? Between us?

447
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,180
是啊 我也不知道这算什么
Yeah, I don't know what it is.

448
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:58,000
可能是现在没有糖果雨之类的吧
Maybe it's an absence of a lot of candy...

449
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,300
但感觉就是不同了
but it's not the same.

450
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:04,040
麦克斯 强尼 我就觉得听到你们声音了
Max! Johnny! I thought I heard you.

451
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,320
麦克斯
Max!

452
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:08,800
我出不来啊
I can't get out!

453
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:10,500
或许只有在你有个女朋友时
Maybe we're only at our best

454
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,100
才是我们最适合的时候吧
when you have another girlfriend.

455
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,540
等你泡到新妞了再打给我吧
Maybe give me a call when you get that going

456
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:15,780
大概也就十分钟后的事
in, like, ten minutes.

457
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:19,680
或者在我婚礼当天打给你
Or I could just call you on my actual wedding day.

458
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:20,700
那也行啊
Oh, cool!

459
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:22,040
仪式前30分钟
Yeah, just call me 30 minutes

460
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:23,780
打给我 我会准时到场的
before the service, and I'll be there.

461
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:26,579
或者在你五十周年结婚纪念日打给我吧
Or better yet, call me at, like, your 50th wedding anniversary.

462
00:20:26,579 --> 00:20:28,747
你这样才迷人嘛
Yeah, now that's hot.

463
00:20:29,220 --> 00:20:29,680
麦克斯
Max!

464
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,380
强尼 我好冷
Johnny! I'm cold!

465
00:20:34,865 --> 00:20:36,730
吻别吗
Kiss good-bye?

466
00:20:38,580 --> 00:20:40,900
你们俩 我脚趾冻得没感觉了
Seriously, guys, I can't feel my toes!

467
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:46,060
你看 我们一分手 又来电了
See, it's hot again 'cause we broke up!

468
00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:49,480
我的五十周年纪念见吧
I'll see you at my 50th,

469
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,540
或在那之前也行
If not before.

470
00:20:56,900 --> 00:20:58,580
派对这么搞 现在又来
First the party, now this.

471
00:20:58,740 --> 00:21:00,740
哪天我办派对 绝对不邀请你
When I have a party, you won't be on the list.

472
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:03,800
你说得对 那是我应得的惩罚
You're right. I deserve that.

473
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:05,760
别啊 我打算办一个街舞派对
No, I was doing a power move.

474
00:21:05,820 --> 00:21:07,280
求你了 你一定得来啊
Please, I'm begging you to come.

475
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,633
再说吧
we'll see.

476
00:21:10,633 --> 00:21:12,060
到时候我可能没空
I might be a little too busy

477
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:14,580
得忙我成功的小蛋糕店事业呢
with my big, successful cupcake shop,

478
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:15,800
所以你去死吧
So suck it.
